{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/834733997837cc05b167542f7faa5cf6.poster.avif?t=1766268551\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/834733997837cc05b167542f7faa5cf6.webm?t=1766268551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/834733997837cc05b167542f7faa5cf6.mp4?t=1766268551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Swordhaven is a fantasy cRPG inspired by Infinity Engine titles\u2014Baldur\u2019s Gate 1, Icewind Dale, etc.\u2014as well as other classics.<br><br>You take up the mantle of a lonely adventurer on their way to the barely explored land of Nova Drakonia.<br><br>During your voyage, you are met by a dying man who trusts you with a peculiar artefact that will involve you in an adventure of a lifetime, and a plot that threatens everything you\u2019ve ever known and loved.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/503977cf2462b01ac79f55fe6c268ecb.poster.avif?t=1766268551\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/503977cf2462b01ac79f55fe6c268ecb.webm?t=1766268551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/503977cf2462b01ac79f55fe6c268ecb.mp4?t=1766268551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some of Swordhaven\u2019s core features include:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/a924db2bf17dce8f44e5cf82ef5b5280.webp?t=1766268551\" width=10 height=10 /></span> A flexible combat engine. Experience battle as a tactician in turn-based combat, or hasten the pace with the real-time with pause (RTwP) mode;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/a924db2bf17dce8f44e5cf82ef5b5280.webp?t=1766268551\" width=10 height=10 /></span> A classless roleplaying system: each stat combination provides a unique gaming experience, distinctive dialogues, and novel ways to solve quests;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/a924db2bf17dce8f44e5cf82ef5b5280.webp?t=1766268551\" width=10 height=10 /></span> A classics-inspired yet modern User Interface with large customization possibilities;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/a924db2bf17dce8f44e5cf82ef5b5280.webp?t=1766268551\" width=10 height=10 /></span> A vast, nonlinear world filled with unique NPCs and multi-solution quests that reward exploration, always offering alternative approaches to satisfy any character build;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/a924db2bf17dce8f44e5cf82ef5b5280.webp?t=1766268551\" width=10 height=10 /></span> Dozens of hours of exploration, from quiet village hamlets to hidden temples of the ancients, horrid crypts, bizarre dungeons, and otherworldly locales\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/extras/f41f7e283eacba6ef9c0a302b19705cf.avif?t=1766268551\" width=616 height=300 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please add us to your Wishlist! </h2><i>Wishlisting is very important for our game's visibility, but it also helps us determine which language we should prioritize for localization. If you wish to help us <strong>translate the game to your language</strong>, consider adding us to your Wishlist.</i>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Nova Drakonia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2108180/2253b0bc6a1e6d8c9dc92af3261acf9c366d7a4e.jpg"},{"name":"The One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2108180/310ebe4e7298e5c67c40a44a379daab7fbad03c8.jpg"},{"name":"Crack the Pots","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2108180/9593802a66120fc62180c40b3ca03365586df3c4.jpg"},{"name":"Mama Croc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2108180/3486118300daf8bd31c89e277a0c6bb7b37e1ad1.jpg"},{"name":"No Traps Allowed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2108180/87cb5bd1e10a5bb01972bca0ce70ac730e7aad20.jpg"},{"name":"Jelly Melly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2108180/50b79b7771b9eec1f86e9ff63578c43ca5edeac2.jpg"},{"name":"Meeting a Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2108180/9c237e7ceeb62d2e6c97fc804177698905c4081b.jpg"},{"name":"Kaixo!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2108180/c157e133a794f6bdd3ea3bd07c9b6b326a4989c8.jpg"},{"name":"The Other","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2108180/6144da52ee6c4ffbab40d2013e8ba17e89eb2f54.jpg"},{"name":"Bauska's Bludgeon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2108180/5a201f80816d04a261201f46f753a58a1973171c.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2108180?t=1766268551","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2108180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766268